      "cooked": "<p>So, the third villain revealed is the Proletariat, the Soviet-themed multiplying man, who seems to have a bit of a grudge with Absolute Zero.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Everyone knew this would happen, but it's still pretty cool to see it confirmed. Also now he has a name.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>All that's left for them to reveal is Tachy-not and Captain Blade.</p>",
