      "raw": "<p>I&#39;d be surprised if it works this way since villain mechanics usually don&#39;t get repeated, but I would imagine the clones working like Akash&#39;Bhuta limbs, where each target will have hit points but deal damage to the main villain card when defeated. That way damage dealt to the copies is felt by the main person.</p>",
